---
title: "Pump driver"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: off
    lg1: running
    lg2: fault
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 orange
  s0: Off
  s1: Relay write failed
  s2: Running
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the relay refuses to close
  s0 --> s2: a plateau starts the pump
  s1 --> s0: reset after a failed relay write
  s2 --> s0: emergency stop or the safety timer fires or the run stops
  class s0 tan
  class s1 orange
  class s2 teal
